{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-lam-5-1","title":"Lamentations 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 A pitiful complaint of Zion in prayer unto God.</p>\n<p>Remember. 1:20; 2:20; 3:19; Ne 1:8; Job 7:7; 10:9; Jer 15:15; Hab 3:2 Lu 23:42 behold. 2:15; 3:61; Ne 1:3; 4:4; Ps 44:13-16; 74:10,11; 79:4,12; 89:50,51 Ps 123:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-2","title":"Lamentations 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>De 28:30-68; Ps 79:1,2; Isa 1:7; 5:17; 63:18; Jer 6:12; Eze 7:21,24 Zep 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-3","title":"Lamentations 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Ex 22:24; Jer 18:21; Ho 14:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-4","title":"Lamentations 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>have. De 28:48; Isa 3:1; Eze 4:9-17 is sold. Heb. cometh for price.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-5","title":"Lamentations 5:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Our necks are under persecution. Heb. On our necks are wepersecuted. 1:14; 4:19; De 28:48,65,66; Jer 27:2,8,11,12; 28:14; Mt 11:29 Ac 15:10 labour. Ne 9:36,37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-6","title":"Lamentations 5:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>given. Ge 24:2; 2Ki 10:15; Jer 50:15; Eze 17:18 to the Egyptians. Isa 30:1-6; 31:1-3; 57:9; Jer 2:18,36; 44:12-14; Ho 5:13; 7:11; 9:3 Ho 12:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-7","title":"Lamentations 5:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>fathers. Ex 20:5; Jer 16:12; 31:29; Eze 18:2; Mt 23:32-36 and are. Ge 42:13,36; Job 7:8,21; Jer 31:15; Zec 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-8","title":"Lamentations 5:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Servants. Ge 9:25; De 28:43; Ne 2:19; 5:15; Pr 30:22 there. Job 5:4; 10:7; Ps 7:2; 50:22; Isa 43:13; Ho 2:10; Zec 11:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-9","title":"Lamentations 5:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Jud 6:11; 2Sa 23:17; Jer 40:9-12; 41:1-10,18; 42:14,16 Eze 4:16,17; 12:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-10","title":"Lamentations 5:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>skin. 3:4; 4:8; Job 30:30; Ps 119:83 terrible famine. or, terrors, or storms, of famine.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-11","title":"Lamentations 5:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>De 28:30; Isa 13:16; Zec 14:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-12","title":"Lamentations 5:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>2:10,20; 4:16; Isa 47:6; Jer 39:6,7; 52:10,11,25-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-13","title":"Lamentations 5:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the young. Ex 11:5; Jud 16:21; Job 31:10; Isa 47:2 fell. Ex 1:11; 2:11; 23:5; Ne 5:1-5; Isa 58:6; Mt 23:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-14","title":"Lamentations 5:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>elders. 1:4,19; 2:10; De 16:18; Job 29:7-17; 30:1; Isa 3:2,3 the young. Job 30:31; Isa 24:7-11; Jer 7:34; 16:9; 25:10; Eze 26:13; Re 18:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-15","title":"Lamentations 5:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>our dance. Ps 30:11; Am 6:4-7; 8:10; Jas 4:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-16","title":"Lamentations 5:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>The crown. 1:1; Job 19:9; Ps 89:39; Jer 13:18; Eze 21:26; Re 2:10; 3:11 is fallen from our head. Heb. of our head is fallen. woe. 1:8,18; 2:1; 4:13; Pr 14:34; Isa 3:9-11; Jer 2:17,19; 4:18 Eze 7:17-22; 22:12-16; 2Pe 2:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-17","title":"Lamentations 5:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>our heart. 1:13,22; Le 26:36; Isa 1:5; Jer 8:18; 46:5; Eze 21:7,15; Mic 6:13 our eyes. 2:11; De 28:65; Job 17:7; Ps 6:7; 31:9; 69:3; Isa 38:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-18","title":"Lamentations 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>of the. 2:8,9; 1Ki 9:7,8; Ps 74:2,3; Jer 17:3; 26:9; 52:13; Mic 3:12 the foxes. Isa 32:13,14; Jer 9:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-19","title":"Lamentations 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>remainest. De 33:27; Ps 9:7; 10:16; 29:10; 90:2; 102:12,25-27; Hab 1:12 1Ti 1:17; 6:15,16; Heb 1:10-12; 13:8; Re 1:4,8,17,18 thy throne. Ps 45:6; 145:13; 146:10; Da 2:44; 7:14,27; Heb 1:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-20","title":"Lamentations 5:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>dost. Ps 13:1; 44:24; 74:1; 77:7-10; 79:5; 85:5; 89:46; 94:3,4; Isa 64:9-12 Jer 14:19-21 so long time. Heb. for length of days.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-21","title":"Lamentations 5:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Turn. 1Ki 18:37; Ps 80:3,7,19; 85:4; Jer 31:18; 32:39,40; Eze 11:19,20 Eze 36:25-27,37; Hab 3:2 renew. Jer 31:4,23-25; 33:10,13; Zec 8:3-6; Mal 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-lam-5-22","title":"Lamentations 5:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LAM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>But thou hast utterly rejected us. or, For wilt thou utterlyreject us? Ps 44:9; 60:1,2; Jer 15:1-5; Eze 37:11; Ho 1:6</p>"}]}